Package: chorale
Title: Shared Latent State Estimation Across Disjoint Multi-Omics
    Modalities
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Francesco", "Lescai", , "francesco.lescai@unipv.it", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates a shared latent biological state across molecular
    modalities measured on disjoint sample sets, using identification
    results for unpaired multi-domain linear latent models. Provides
    pathway-constrained, interpretable factors together with
    falsifiability controls, including permutation calibration and
    initialisation stability diagnostics, and reports
    partial-identification bounds on the cross-modality coupling.
